 8️⃣ Orchestration Saga (Message-based) Kafka Command topic
 
 Flow
 
SagaOrchestrator
   ↓ Command
PaymentService → InventoryService → ShippingService
 
 Orchestrator Code (Simplified)

java
@Service
public class OrderSagaOrchestrator {

    public void startSaga(Order order) {
        sendChargePayment(order);
    }

    public void onPaymentSuccess() {
        sendReserveInventory();
    }

    public void onInventoryFailure() {
        sendRefundPayment();
    }
}

 Why Orchestration is less preferred
❌ Central bottleneck  
❌ Harder to extend  
❌ Tighter coupling  

